      "headline": "Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro campaign in freefall after Dark Horse/Vorcaro audio revelations",
      "summary": "The Intercept Brasil's publication of an audio in which Senator Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro (PL-RJ) asked disgraced Banco Master banker Daniel Vorcaro to pay film financing installments for the Jair Bolsonaro biopic 'Dark Horse' triggered a cascading campaign crisis: the communications director Marcel\u00e3o was fired in chaotic circumstances; PL's primary strategist Duda Lima publicly declined to run the campaign; financial market figures described Fl\u00e1vio as 'toxic'; Fl\u00e1vio travelled to Washington seeking a Trump meeting to reset the narrative while Eduardo Bolsonaro called police on an Intercept journalist at his Texas home; and the Intercept published additional scandal reporting linking Cl\u00e1udio Castro and the broader Bolsonaro political network to the scandal.",
